  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4df0014cb02a0cf4bbbc7addabd2224a, type: 3}
  m_Name: GoodEndingDialogue NG+++
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: All right, now that's a smart boy!
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: Whew, you got me worried for a sec there, not gonna lie.
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: Turns out you're not a full psycopath after all.
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: Did I ever fully introduce myself to you? My name's Humberto Garcia Sauvignon.
      I won't bother asking yours.
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: You know what? I could use the help of someone like you. I'll need every
      support I can get to enact my vegeance. Gertrud must pay.
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: 'Think about it, will you? I can teach you magic, among other things. '
  - speakerName: Humberto Garcia Sauvignon
    text: Anyways, let's get out of here, son.
